.DS_Store
**/.DS_STORE

# Internal docs (REVIEW.md, CLAUDE.md, AUDIT-*.md) now live in the
# sibling ../lingua-forge-audit/ folder — physically outside this
# repo. The entries below are belt-and-braces in case any of those
# files ever drift back into this folder by mistake.
REVIEW.md
CLAUDE.md
AUDIT-*.md

# Dev tooling lives in dev/. The heavy install artifacts (vendor/,
# node_modules/, caches) are ignored by dev/.gitignore. The entries
# below are belt-and-braces in case anyone ever runs composer install
# or npm install directly in the plugin root by mistake.

/vendor/
/node_modules/
/build/
/coverage/
.phpcs.cache
.phpunit.result.cache
.phpstan.cache
/.wp-env/
composer.lock
package-lock.json
